1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,141
A man climbed a tree to see Jesus.

2
00:00:03,481 --> 00:00:05,602
But Jesus was looking for him.

3
00:00:05,742 --> 00:00:08,222
Zacchaeus was a chief tax collector at Jericho.

4
00:00:08,862 --> 00:00:11,003
Tax men often took extra money from their own

5
00:00:11,063 --> 00:00:11,403
people.

6
00:00:12,183 --> 00:00:14,344
He was rich, and called a sinner.

7
00:00:15,424 --> 00:00:17,225
He was too short to see over the crowd.

8
00:00:17,345 --> 00:00:20,446
Jesus came by, looked up, and called him by

9
00:00:20,506 --> 00:00:20,806
name.

10
00:00:21,366 --> 00:00:24,987
Zacchaeus, make haste, and come down; for to

11
00:00:25,027 --> 00:00:27,307
day I must abide at thy house.

12
00:00:27,347 --> 00:00:29,408
Jesus must stay at his house today!

13
00:00:31,129 --> 00:00:33,069
Zacchaeus hurried down, full of joy.

14
00:00:33,189 --> 00:00:36,110
The crowd grumbled: Jesus is going to a sinner's

15
00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:36,430
house!

16
00:00:38,010 --> 00:00:39,091
Jesus went anyway.

17
00:00:40,251 --> 00:00:41,551
Jesus came to him first.

18
00:00:42,691 --> 00:00:45,572
Then Zacchaeus stood up and said: Behold, Lord,

19
00:00:46,032 --> 00:00:48,773
the half of my goods I give to the poor.

20
00:00:48,873 --> 00:00:50,013
Half of all he had.

21
00:00:50,894 --> 00:00:53,274
And if he had cheated anyone, he would pay

22
00:00:53,314 --> 00:00:54,555
back four times.

23
00:00:55,115 --> 00:00:58,416
This day is salvation come to this house.

24
00:00:58,836 --> 00:01:01,517
Salvation means God rescues you and brings

25
00:01:01,537 --> 00:01:02,257
you back to Him.

26
00:01:02,397 --> 00:01:06,178
Jesus, the Son of man, said why He came: For

27
00:01:06,198 --> 00:01:09,139
the Son of man is come to seek and to save

28
00:01:09,739 --> 00:01:10,899
that which was lost.

29
00:01:11,039 --> 00:01:12,139
Zacchaeus came to look.

30
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,340
Jesus came to find him.

31
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:16,661
He still looks for the lost.

32
00:01:17,241 --> 00:01:20,322
To save them, He later died for our sins, and

33
00:01:20,382 --> 00:01:22,162
rose again on the third day.
